+`--openaiQuality` overrides only the render tier (`low` = cheapest drafts, `max` = finest detail on 2.5); output dimensions still follow `--quality`/`--size`. Tier availability is model-gated: `xhigh`/`max` require `gpt-image-2.5-flare`/`sunburst`, and explicit tiers are rejected for DALL·E (use the preset there).
